   37                   / symbols not compatible with native macro
   38                   / dcfxxx are single bit flags
   39                   / dcmxxx are multibit masks
   40                   / Channel Request Block first word
   41                   / dcfcrnl - turn newline into carriage return, newline on send
   42                   / dcfflex - flexo mode, do automatic conversion
   43                   / dcfecho - echo received characters
   44                   / dcfioc - interrupt on connection open or close
   45                   / dcfioe - interrupt on socket error
   46                   / dcfior - interroupt on character received
   47                   / dcfie -  enable interrupts for channel
   48                   / dcfsrv - server mode
   49                   / rxlfta - flexo to ascii
   50                   / rxlucs - flexo upper case shift
   51                   / rxlchg - flexo shift state changed
   52                   / dcmsbs - bitmask, sbs channel to use
   53                   / dcmcha - bitmask, channel number for this channel
   54                   
