  107                   / Errors returned in IO, dserr is the error flag
  108                   / dseno - channel not open
  109                   / dseoe - illegal operation on open channel
  110                   / dseic - invalid channel number
  111                   / dsens - server command on non-server channel
  112                   / dseil - illegal command, commdand with illegal options
  113                   / dseso - socket open or operation failed
  114                   / dsebi - server bind to port failed

