  144                   / Put our included code bits here
  145 01000             1000/
  146                   / Wait for an ascii character on the current DCS channel.
  147                   / The IO register is cleared and the character is 
  148                   / returned in the IO register.
  149                   / If an error occurs, the IO register will be the rcs status with bit 0 set to 1.
  150                   / The AC register is preserved.
  151                   / Call via jda getach.
  152                   
  153                   
  154                   
  155                   
  156 01000 000000      getach, 0
  157 01001 241026           dac gachrt
  158                   / loop waiting for a character
  159                   gachlp,
  160 01002 764000           cli
  161 01003 724722           iot rcs
  162 01004 760040           lai
